### ==========================================
### CONNEXA LINKEDIN CLONE API ENDPOINT TESTS
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/home HTTP/1.1

###

### 2. User Registration (v1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mirjaj Ajij Milon",
  "username": "milon_dev",
  "email": "milon_dev@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

###

### 3. User Login (v1) - Save JWT token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "milon_dev@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

###

### 4. Get Current User Details (v1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 5. Get User & Profile Data (v1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/profile HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 6. Update Profile Data (v1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/profile/update HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Senior Software Architect & Fullstack Developer passionate about building high scale web applications.",
  "currentPost": "Chief Technology Officer",
  "pastWork": [
    {
      "company": "Google",
      "position": "Staff Engineer",
      "years": "3 years"
    }
  ],
  "education": [
    {
      "school": "Stanford University",
      "degree": "M.S. Computer Science",
      "fieldOfStudy": "Software Systems"
    }
  ]
}

###

### 7. Get All User Profiles (v1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/all-profiles HTTP/1.1

###

### 8. Download Resume PDF (v1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/download-resume HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 9. Create Post (v1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/create HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Excited to share that we just refactored and hardened the backend for Connexa LinkedIn Clone! 🚀"
}

###

### 10. Get All Posts (v1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts HTTP/1.1

###

### 11. Add Comment to Post (v1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/comments HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "post_id": "REPLACE_WITH_POST_ID",
  "comment": "Congratulations on the milestone! Great architectural setup."
}

###

### 12. Get Comments for a Post (v1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/comments?post_id=REPLACE_WITH_POST_ID HTTP/1.1

###

### 13. Like / Toggle Post (v1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/posts/like HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "post_id": "REPLACE_WITH_POST_ID"
}

###

### 14. Send Connection Request (v1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/connections/send HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "connectionId": "REPLACE_WITH_TARGET_USER_ID"
}

###

### 15. Get Sent Connection Requests (v1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/connections/sent HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 16. Get Received Connection Requests (v1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/connections/received HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 17. Respond to Connection Request (v1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/connections/respond HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "REPLACE_WITH_REQUEST_ID",
  "action_type": "accept"
}

###

### ==========================================
### LEGACY ENDPOINTS (FOR BACKWARD COMPATIBILITY)
### ==========================================

### Legacy Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "milon_dev@example.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### Legacy Get Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/get_user_and_profile HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Legacy Get All Posts
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts HTTP/1.1
